Enhances: xviewer
Description: additional plugins for the Xviewer image viewer
 Xviewer is a GTK image viewer. This package adds plugins for displaying
 Exif data and image locations on a map, exporting images to a folder,
 sending images by mail, shuffling slideshows, and opening a Python console.
